# JANET Web
*.zip
*.tmp
*.log
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
# take-to-work / archives (built, not source)
**/Take to Work/
# runtime spool / uploads (when the server exists)
spool/
uploads/
# runtime package drop-folder (server seeds Log4j staging on boot; env-specific data)
Packages/
# local spool of central-CSV logs when the share is unreachable
JanetLocal/*
# ...but the KEV seed catalog IS shipped (the KEV Cross-Check tool needs it on a
# fresh clone; operator add-kev edits are then version-trackable too)
!JanetLocal/KevCatalog.txt
# ...and the C2C Readiness baseline seed (the C2C tool needs it on a fresh clone;
# operator edits to check thresholds / DoD root thumbprints are then trackable too)
!JanetLocal/c2c-baseline.json
# ...and the STIG Checker rule baseline + Reports SLA deadline baseline (same
# ship-the-seed / track-operator-edits rationale as the two above)
!JanetLocal/stig-baseline.json
!JanetLocal/sla-baseline.json
# ...and the IAVM CVE->IAVA map seed (Reports IAVM tagging + KEV xref need it on a
# fresh clone; operator Add-IAVM edits are then version-trackable too). The SLA
# ledger + target-groups are RUNTIME state (accumulated per operator), so they are
# deliberately NOT negated - they stay ignored.
!JanetLocal/IavmMap.csv
# machine-specific editor/preview config
.claude/
